  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training - Next Generation Networks Workshop Series, through Business Council for International Understanding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting the Next Generation Networks Workshop Series. The Workshop Series will share best practices and recent developments regarding regulatory frameworks and procurement practices related to next generation networks, including fifth generation networks (5G), globally with government officials and industry in emerging markets. The objective of the Workshop Series is to promote the use of U.S. technologies and best practices to support priority 5G infrastructure projects in emerging markets.</narrative>
  </description>
